{
  "slug": "amazon-selling-partner",
  "name": "Amazon Selling Partner",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Connect your Amazon Seller Central account to Claude. Ask about sales, inventory, and listing performance and get recommendations grounded in your own data, then review and approve every listing, inventory or FBA action before it runs. Bundles the Amazon Selling Partner MCP server (Seller Central OAuth on first use). Currently in beta.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **11 skills**, **3 commands** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (11): `fba-inbound-management` (Guides a seller end-to-end through sending inventory to Amazon's fulfillment network: creating an inbound plan, packing, placement, transportation,…), `invite-secondary-users` (Helps the account owner, an administrator, or a permissions manager of a Seller Central account invite their secondary…), `listing-buyability` (Diagnoses why a seller's listing isn't buyable and relays the specific reason plus the next step), `listing-compliance` (Pre-flight compliance gate before any listing write), `listing-issues` (Fixes listing problems that surface as reported issues on a listing — missing or invalid attributes, and suppressions…), `listing-searchability` (Diagnoses why a seller's listing isn't found in search and helps make it more discoverable), `listing-troubleshooter` (Top-level entry point for any \"something's wrong with my listing\" question), `seller-analytics` (Answers a seller's business-performance questions — inventory health, traffic, and sales — by querying the Amazon Selling Partner…), and 3 more\n- **Commands** (3): `sp-fix-listing` (Find your suppressed/inactive listings and fix them (with your approval)), `sp-sales-drop` (Diagnose why your Amazon sales dropped and get safe next steps), `sp-stockout-check` (Check your FBA inventory for stockout risk and get restock/price options (with your approval))\n- **MCP servers** (1): `amazon-selling-partner`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install amazon-selling-partner@claude-plugins-official` from `amzn/selling-partner-agentic-toolkit`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 11,
    "command": 3,
    "mcp": 1
  },
